{"id":"9fa1a80aa97659ab","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-character.md","title":"Character","display":"df-character — Character","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-character","aliases":["58-df-character","Character"],"display":"df-character — Character","depends_on":["[[58-df-arithmetic]]","[[58-df-divisibility]]","[[58-df-dirichlet-character]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-character"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-character</span><span>Character</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-character — Character"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c112e121aec5c9ff\" href=\"?note=c112e121aec5c9ff\" title=\"58-df-arithmetic\">58-df-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"58-df-divisibility\">58-df-divisibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7101d8e1cbc25a43\" href=\"?note=7101d8e1cbc25a43\" title=\"58-df-dirichlet-character\">58-df-dirichlet-character</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(N\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z}\">\\(\\chi\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (divisibility predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"58-df-divisibility\">58-df-divisibility</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (canonical Dirichlet-character predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7101d8e1cbc25a43\" href=\"?note=7101d8e1cbc25a43\" title=\"58-df-dirichlet-character\">58-df-dirichlet-character</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimitiveChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimitiveChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (primitive-character predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}character} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimitiveChar}_S(\\chi,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,N)\\land\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Div}(d,N)\\land 0&lt;d&lt;N)\\to\\neg\\exists\\chi_d\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi_d,d)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\gcd(a,N)=1\\to\\chi(a)=\\chi_d(a))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}character} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimitiveChar}_S(\\chi,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,N)\\land\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Div}(d,N)\\land 0&lt;d&lt;N)\\to\\neg\\exists\\chi_d\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi_d,d)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\gcd(a,N)=1\\to\\chi(a)=\\chi_d(a))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The base Dirichlet-character predicate is imported rather than redefined; this file adds only primitivity. A character modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> is induced from modulus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\mid N\">\\(d\\mid N\\)</span> exactly when their values agree on integers coprime to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A Dirichlet character is complex-valued, not <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C^*\">\\(\\mathbb C^*\\)</span>-valued, because it vanishes on integers not coprime to the modulus.</li>\n<li>The associated <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-series is not introduced as a free global symbol here; <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"53fcdabad44b89e5\" href=\"?note=53fcdabad44b89e5\" title=\"58-df-dirichlet\">58-df-dirichlet</a> defines its value relation from the coefficients <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(n)\">\\(\\chi(n)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-function: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(s, \\chi_0) = \\zeta(s)\">\\(L(s, \\chi_0) = \\zeta(s)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(s, \\chi) \\neq 0\">\\(L(s, \\chi) \\neq 0\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi \\neq \\chi_0\">\\(\\chi \\neq \\chi_0\\)</span> at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=1\">\\(s=1\\)</span></li>\n<li>Hecke characters: idele class characters; broader class than Dirichlet</li>\n<li>Class field theory: Artin reciprocity gives character on ideal class group</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Davenport, Multiplicative Number Theory</li>\n<li>Iwaniec, Topics in Classical Automorphic Forms</li>\n<li>Montgomery and Vaughan, Multiplicative Number Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"c112e121aec5c9ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-divisibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dirichlet-character","status":"resolved","id":"7101d8e1cbc25a43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dirichlet-character]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (divisibility predicate, see [[58-df-divisibility]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dirichlet-character","status":"resolved","id":"7101d8e1cbc25a43","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (canonical Dirichlet-character predicate, see [[58-df-dirichlet-character]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dirichlet","status":"resolved","id":"53fcdabad44b89e5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The associated $L$-series is not introduced as a free global symbol here; [[58-df-dirichlet]] defines its value relation from the coefficients $\\chi(n)$.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb Z}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimitiveChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}character} \\vdash \\mathrm{PrimitiveChar}_S(\\chi,N)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,N)\\land\\forall d\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Div}(d,N)\\land 0<d<N)\\to\\neg\\exists\\chi_d\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi_d,d)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\gcd(a,N)=1\\to\\chi(a)=\\chi_d(a))\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"d\\mid N","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C^*","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi(n)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L(s, \\chi_0) = \\zeta(s)","display":false},{"tex":"L(s, \\chi) \\neq 0","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi \\neq \\chi_0","display":false},{"tex":"s=1","display":false}],"bytes":1977,"backlinks":[{"id":"53fcdabad44b89e5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2ec4ebda68aa360b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-268","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-character.md|58-df-character]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["c112e121aec5c9ff","b932045a4446f26a","7101d8e1cbc25a43","53fcdabad44b89e5"]}